# Paths this upstream owns (docs/UPSTREAM.md).
#
# An upstream sync takes every path listed here exactly as the upstream has it,
# deletions included. Every path NOT listed belongs to the site, and a sync
# never changes it: root composer.json and composer.lock (the lock is updated,
# never replaced), config/, custom modules and themes, deploy/settings.site.php,
# .ddev/, README, CHANGELOG and the site's own docs.
#
# A line ending in "/" is a directory and covers everything under it; any other
# line is one file. Blank lines and "#" comments are ignored.

